---
<section class="hero-compact" aria-label="Hero">
  <h1>Your home should fit you, not the other way around.</h1>
  <p>
    A 2‑session, hands‑on layout and systems service for renters in Hong Kong
    who want a calm, functional home using <em>mostly what they already have</em> –
    not a buy‑everything‑new makeover.
  </p>
  <p class="hero-tag">Because even a one‑year rental deserves a real home.</p>

  <div class="hero-actions">
    <a class="btn-primary" href="https://docs.google.com/forms/d/e/1FAIpQLScMhkQxJpi7S7oCcPvw5a082q0Zt38LkCtar3LjJriCU107GA/viewform" target="_blank" rel="noreferrer">Book a free 15‑minute Home Fit Call</a>
    <p class="hero-secondary">Or WhatsApp me 3 photos: <a href="https://wa.me/85290543117">+852 9054 3117</a></p>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .hero-compact {
    background: var(--bg);
    color: var(--heading);
    padding: 1rem 0 3rem;
  }

  .hero-compact h1 {
    margin: 0;
    font-size: clamp(2.6rem, 6vw, 4.2rem);
    line-height: 1.02;
    color: var(--heading);
  }

  .hero-compact p {
    margin: 0.75rem 0 0;
    color: var(--text);
    max-width: 56ch;
  }

  .hero-tag {
    margin-top: 0.6rem;
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .hero-actions {
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
  }

  .btn-primary {
    display: inline-block;
    padding: 0.8rem 1.6rem;
    background: var(--accent-tan);
    color: var(--bg);
    border-radius: 999px;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .btn-primary:hover {
    border: 2px solid var(--accent-teal);
    padding: 0.68rem 1.48rem;
  }

  .hero-secondary {
    margin-top: 0.75rem;
    font-size: 0.95rem;
  }

  .hero-secondary a { color: var(--accent-teal); }

  @media (max-width: 720px) {
    .hero-compact {
      padding-bottom: 2.25rem;
    }

    .btn-primary {
      display: block;
      width: 100%;
      text-align: center;
    }
  }
</style>
